# Copy to ads.env (git-ignored). Real ids come from the owner's AdMob account (dashboard phase 4).
# Build a release with:  flutter build appbundle --release --dart-define-from-file=ads.env
# The Android build also reads FEMIO_ADMOB_APP_ID from this file for the manifest; without
# the file, Google's test ids below are used.
# These values are Google's published TEST ids: safe to commit, they serve test ads only.
